# One line away from aa-counter-guard: a scout walks the pool circuit
# farthest-first and its sightings persist through the fog, so the counter
# tilt reacts to what was seen rather than only to what is currently shooting
# ([[community-play-strategies]]).

name aa-counter-guard-scout
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank
heavies none
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 1
cover 1
intercept 1
guard_cap 0
aa_cover 0
forward 0
scout 1
raid 0
rush 0
creep 0
riposte 0
tech 0
